OL,3,A#170 a bag? Protein users squeezed as
OL,4,Aprices soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmarpreet Singh has been drinking
OL,7,Fprotein shakes since he was 16.
OL,9,FThe 30-year-old, who lives in London
OL,10,Fand works in banking, started going to
OL,11,Fthe gym at a time when he says protein
OL,12,Fsupplements were mostly associated with
OL,13,Fbodybuilders.
OL,15,FFourteen years later, shakes are still
OL,16,Fpart of his routine, but they have
OL,17,Fbecome considerably more expensive.
OL,19,FHe says a 4.5kg bag of the whey protein
OL,20,Fhe buys cost around #60 in 2020.
